WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:02.520
Good morning guys.
It is still dark.&nbsp;

00:00:02.520 --> 00:00:04.000
Nikita is awake.
She's got her fishing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.200
clothes on because we are going fishing.
We are going to Cape Town Hout Bay.&nbsp;

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:15.640
We are about 10:30 I think minutes away from&nbsp;
our location and my stomach is in trouble.&nbsp;

00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:19.200
Houston we have a problem.
I'm going to run.&nbsp;

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:29.960
It's not funny Nikita.
Stop laughing.&nbsp;

00:00:30.480 --> 00:00:40.840
I missed it all.
Never eat prawns curried.

